    {
      "id": "claim_69fba185cda94d26931832dc1eaa25c0",
      "statement": "arrayLiteral renders only 1-D arrays as new <type>[]{...}; nested arrays throw. The element type is inferred from the first non-null element via elementJavaType, which maps bare boolean/string/number and the {type} wrapper forms, throws on null (cannot infer) and on nested arrays.",
