    {
      "id": "claim_92bdef88176c4ce5ba915b33f62602f9",
      "statement": "literalForArg infers an empty array's element type from a sibling case: it scans the same argument position across all cases of the check and, if another case has a non-empty array, uses that sibling's first non-null element to infer the hint for arrayLiteral. With no usable sibling the empty array defaults to int[].",
