    {
      "id": "claim_b02d014ba8d14c08841b34b5b284c1f5",
      "statement": "public/sandbox-worker.js runs CheerpJ in a dedicated Worker (so a tight infinite loop can be hard-stopped via terminate() without wedging the timeout owner). Because there is no DOM in the Worker, CheerpJ stdout/stderr land on the worker's console.log/error; the worker monkey-patches console.log/error/warn/info to append stringified args (joined with spaces) plus a trailing newline into a captured buffer, then forwards to the original.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://public/sandbox-worker.js#L1-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:caa85b37f56d0506d63b7f48b04112e34c6ac9774680596cade6dd7296081091:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_46b5da6c52be4d4a9101cd83abc3fe66",
      "statement": "The worker compiles <mainClass>.java + KataRunner.java via com.sun.tools.javac.Main (classpath /app/tools.jar:/files/) against in-memory string files; a non-zero compile exit reports compile-error with the trimmed captured output. It then runs KataRunner via cheerpjRunMain and parses the captured console text: an ERR_PREFIX line yields runtime-error with the first line after the prefix; OUT_BEGIN/OUT_END bound the stdout block; every RET_PREFIX line contributes an ordered {json} entry to returns.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://public/sandbox-worker.js#L44-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:37a44f0de0b1c07ef596a22fb9b72d770f847892672455dd1f2a74cd984c03e7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_04b76336979b4788804b0aa41fb77cd9",
      "statement": "The worker strips ALL leading and trailing blank lines from the stdout block (slice between OUT_BEGIN and OUT_END then replace /^\\n+/ and /\\n+$/), because CheerpJ's console bridge can flush print() vs println() into a different number of underlying writes than the Java calls made, so only the sentinel positions — not the exact newline count around the captured block — are reliable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://public/sandbox-worker.js#L73-L82",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a204b7955bcfb8f131d2b8b975e33368b01ca28fd8d9ff719b8425691795c321:"
        }
      ]
