      "statement": "src/runner/runner.ts generates harnessSource via generateHarness(req.mainClass, req.checks) on every runJava call and tears down the sandbox iframe after each run (ok, error, timeout, or stop), rebuilding a fresh one on the next run. This avoids a stale Main/KataRunner class being served from a previous run under the same class names.",
