      "id": "claim_ccebba8765b84bfd9cfef4f636ef38a8",
      "statement": "For stdout checks, verifyResult normalizes both the expected and actual strings with normalizeStdout before comparing for equality. normalizeStdout converts \\r\\n to \\n, strips trailing per-line whitespace ([ \\t]+$), and strips trailing newlines, tolerating CRLF, missing trailing newlines, trailing blank lines, and trailing spaces while preserving internal blank lines.",
