      "statement": "Return cases are positional: verifyResult keeps a single returnIdx counter that increments across checks in order, taking result.returns[returnIdx++] per case and JSON.parse-ing its json (parseActual returns undefined on parse failure or a missing entry, which makes the case fail). A return check passes only if every case passes; the verdict is solved only if every check passes.",
