    {
      "id": "claim_183969f53e3946debfdf737ee5f528ad",
      "statement": "The runner arms an INIT_BUDGET_MS (90 s) timer covering CheerpJ load + compile; when the sandbox reports phase 'running' it clears that budget and arms the kata's timeoutMs instead. The phase messages flow worker→iframe→host, and the same running-phase budget swap is mirrored in both src/runner/runner.ts and public/sandbox.js so either layer can fire a timeout without relying on the Java thread yielding.",
